    {
      "name": "Numb Senses",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A living creature hit by a void ooze's pseudopod Strike must succeed at a DC 25 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Dazzled and Deafened until the end of the creature's next turn (Blinded and deafened on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>This numbs all of the creature's perceptive senses (such as smell, taste, and touch), applying the dazzled and blinded conditions' effects to other precise senses the creature might have.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Shades Linger",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "darkness",
        "occult"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The void ooze unleashes a pulse of magical darkness in a 30ft Type:emanation. Nonmagical light is automatically extinguished for 1 minute. The ooze also attempts to counteract any 3rd-rank or lower magical light effect in this area (counteract rank 3, counteract modifier +17).</p>",
